    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a darkly whimsical tale of magic, morality, and twisted family values. You play as Lucas, a reluctant young witch trapped in a bizarre household where dinner isn\u2019t just served\u2014it\u2019s hunted, prepared, and consumed with dark intent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you embrace your parents' ways, find the courage to forge your own path, or fall prey to the cutthroat world of witches where it\u2019s truly &quot;eat or be eaten&quot;?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story-driven walk-and-talk adventure game where you\u2019ll:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a dark and twisted world that feels like Harry Potter took a wrong turn into a sinister fairy tale.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve light puzzles, including deadly cooking challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Lucas, a reluctant young witch trying to escape a twisted, cannibalistic upbringing while navigating a world of dark magic, tough choices, and unexpected alliances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make choices that shape the story and its outcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide who lives, who dies, and who ends up on the menu.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover multiple endings, each revealing a different side of the tale.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a darkly whimsical tale of magic, morality, and twisted family values. You play as Lucas, a reluctant young witch trapped in a bizarre household where dinner isn\u2019t just served\u2014it\u2019s hunted, prepared, and consumed with dark intent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you embrace your parents' ways, find the courage to forge your own path, or fall prey to the cutthroat world of witches where it\u2019s truly &quot;eat or be eaten&quot;?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story-driven walk-and-talk adventure game where you\u2019ll:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a dark and twisted world that feels like Harry Potter took a wrong turn into a sinister fairy tale.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve light puzzles, including deadly cooking challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Lucas, a reluctant young witch trying to escape a twisted, cannibalistic upbringing while navigating a world of dark magic, tough choices, and unexpected alliances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make choices that shape the story and its outcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide who lives, who dies, and who ends up on the menu.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover multiple endings, each revealing a different side of the tale.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A walk-and-talk indie adventure game where you and your dysfunctional witch parents cook teens to stay young and powerful. But when they bring in a charming girl as your next meal, will you uphold the family tradition or risk everything to save her?",
